            <https://doi.org/10.5962/bhl.title.11574>,
            <https://doi.org/10.6028/jres.060.043> ;
        pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-19-coral-calice-septa-insertion-audit-v3-thomas-coral-calice-septa-insertion-1>,
