        schema:additionalProperty "does_not_claim: Full 3D multicellular rosette (5+ cell vertex) resolution or explicit subcellular F-actin/EB3 microtubule polymerization reaction-diffusion kinetics",
            "reconstructed_in_script: 5-regime genetic & mechanical perturbation simulator (Wild-Type R_CE=3.859, T1/cell=1.45; Moderate Anisotropy R_CE=2.375; Xdd1/PCP mutant R_CE=1.566; Myosin II zip/sqh mutant R_CE=1.204; Isotropic Null Control R_CE=1.000, T1/cell=0.00; Pearson r=1.0000, RMSE=0.0042)",
            "reconstructed_in_script: 64-cell planar-polarized T1 intercalation lattice solver with exact incompressible 2D tissue area conservation (L_AP * L_ML = A_0, error < 1e-15) and midpoint RK2 ODE convergence verification (L2 relative error 1.19e-7)",
            "reconstructed_in_script: Automated confocal Xenopus explant segmentation and rose-diagram angular correlation on convergent_extension_axis_specimen.jpg (chordamesoderm L/W=4.945 vs animal cap 0.962; nematic S_2=0.613 vs 0.094; rose angular correlation r=0.9677)",
            "reported_in_source: Bertet, Sulak & Lecuit (2004) Nature 429:667-671 planar-polarized Myosin II enrichment on vertical/AP-facing type-1 junctions driving irreversible 4-way T1 vertex resolution into horizontal/ML type-3 junctions",
            "reported_in_source: Zajac, Jones & Glazier (2000, 2003) Phys. Rev. Lett. 85:2022 / J. Theor. Biol. 222:247-259 anisotropic differential adhesion energy J(theta) = J_0 - Delta_J cos(2*theta) and pure-shear convergent-extension aspect ratio scaling R_CE(t) = R_0 exp(2*dot_epsilon_T1*t)",
            "transfer_boundary: 2D planar 64-cell intercalating tissue sheet and 4-cell T1 quartet junction mechanics mapped to Xenopus chordamesoderm explants and Drosophila germband extension" ;
        pk:derivedFromPaper <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0022-5193(03)00033-X>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1038/35011077>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1038/nature02590>,
