ofacial axis, snout apex, 40-bin dorsal head width profile (r=0.9114), and bilateral dorsolateral eye detection (N=2 eyes, |Delta s|=0.0023) on xenopus_craniofacial_specimen.jpg; transfer_boundary: 2D dorsal Procrustes craniofacial landmark coordinates (left/right eye, left/right naris, jaw midpoint) and reconstructed froglet head contour compared against dorsal Xenopus laevis specimen geometry; does_not_claim: 3D finite-element cartilage biomechanics of Meckel's/palatoquadrate chondrocytes or explicit collagen-I fibril cleavage kinetics]" ;
