            <https://doi.org/10.1242/dev.126.4.827>,
            <https://doi.org/10.7554/eLife.05042> ;
        ns1:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-brodland-differential-interfacial-tension-sorting-code-traceability>,
