ctoderm fraction = 0.6353); transfer_boundary: Reduced 2D sagittal voxel spring-lattice and orbital stem-cell sweeping kinematics calibrated to 3D VoxCAD and wet-lab Xenopus laevis biobot trajectories; does_not_claim: Full 3D fluid-structure Stokes ciliary boundary-element hydrodynamics or single-cell transcriptomic reprogramming after laceration]" ;
