men segmentation on drosophila_ventral_furrow_specimen.jpg (DV/ML aspect 1.050 -> 1.029 -> 0.962 -> 0.922, trajectory r=0.9942); transfer_boundary: 2D transverse cross-sectional viscoelastic ring of 64 trapezoidal cells mapped to confocal transverse sections of Drosophila ventral furrow formation; does_not_claim: Full 3D anteroposterior cephalic furrow / germband extension viscous shell hydrodynamics or explicit subcellular Rho1-Rok-Myosin II reaction-diffusion kinetics]" ;
