            <https://doi.org/10.1242/dev.78.1.83>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1242/dev.89.1.93> ;
        ns1:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-oster-mechanochemical-chondrogenesis-code-traceability>,
