n width profile segmentation on salamander_limb_regeneration_specimen.jpg (Pearson r = 0.8711) and 2D 4-digit forelimb silhouette synthesis; transfer_boundary: Proximodistal 3-segment active-inference trajectories mapped onto 2D articulated Ambystoma mexicanum forelimb silhouettes and joint landmarks; does_not_claim: Single-cell transcriptomic trajectories of blastema dedifferentiation or 3D finite-element bone mineralization mechanics]" ;
