ntour and bilateral photoreceptor ocelli segmentation on planarian_ap_polarity_specimen.jpg (N=2 eyespots at x/L=0.0528, length=1478 px) and 2D body-plan silhouette synthesis; transfer_boundary: 1D anteroposterior electrodiffusive 5-HT, beta-catenin, and ERK profiles mapped onto 2D dorsal planarian body-plan silhouettes and eyespot coordinates; does_not_claim: Full 3D finite-volume Voronoi cell lattice geometry of BETSE or explicit sub-millisecond action potential spiking]" ;
