            <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.1079354>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1511/2004.3.254> ;
        ns1:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves-code-traceability>,
