unay contact-chain loss on noisy capitula used to model the empirical excess of Fibonacci-1 over Fibonacci+1 counts in Swinton et al. (2016); does_not_claim: Full 3D auxin PIN1 transport PDE simulation on a curved dome (uses Vogel's kinematic spiral and Douady & Couder's effective Hofmeister inhibitory potential)]; other sources: Phyllotaxis: A Systemic Study in Plant Morphogenesis <https://www.cambridge.org/9780521404822>" ;
        ns1:derivedFromPaper <https://doi.org/10.1006/jtbi.1996.0024>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1016/0025-5564(79)90080-4>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1098/rsos.160091>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.68.2098> ;
