morphospace | Automated CV segmentation of the 72 hpf Danio rerio larval retina confocal micrograph (concentric inner nuclear r=295 px and outer plexiform r=392 px rings, 60-bin radial fluorescence profile r=0.9897, and N=415 neural clusters across the nasal-temporal arc); transfer_boundary: Normalized 1D nasal-temporal retinal coordinate x in [0, 1] and rostral-caudal tectal/collicular coordinate y in [0, 1] coupled via the 40x40 synaptic weight matrix W_ij; does_not_claim: Subcellular growth-cone filopodial actin polymerization or EphB/ephrin-B dorsoventral mediolateral axis guidance]" ;
        ns1:derivedFromPaper <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0092-8674(00)00012-X>,
