            "reconstructed_in_script: Automated segmentation of neural_crest_specimen.jpg (Panel A control vs Panel C BMPR-inhibited) quantifying dorsoventral chaser-runner separation (+0.4063), inter-placode spacing CV (0.0457), BMPR ventral stream loss (0.5877), and dorsoventral density profile correlation (r = 0.9225, RMSE = 0.2640)",
            "reported_in_source: Carmona-Fontaine et al. (2008, 2011) and Woods et al. (2014) PLOS ONE 9:e104969 short-range PCP/RhoA contact inhibition of locomotion (CIL) and autocrine C3a/C3aR co-attraction (COA) stabilizing collective cluster migration",
            "reported_in_source: Theveneau et al. (2013) Nat. Cell Biol. 15:763-772 five-regime chase-and-run hierarchy across wild-type NC + placode (FMI = 0.68, 6h disp = 185 um), stationary Sdf1 bead (FMI = 0.42, disp = 95 um), N-cadherin/DshDep+ CIL blockade (FMI = 0.28, disp = 54 um), C3aR-MO COA ablation (FMI = 0.21, disp = 38 um), and placode/Sdf1 ablation (FMI = 0.04, disp = 12 um)",
