            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-19-magnetic-drop-phyllotaxis-audit-v3-douady-magnetic-drop-phyllotaxis-13>,
            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-19-magnetic-drop-phyllotaxis-audit-v3-douady-magnetic-drop-phyllotaxis-14>,
