            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-19-wnt-dkk-hair-follicle-audit-v3-sick-wnt-dkk-hair-follicle-9> ;
        pk:hypothesisType "Activator-Inhibitor Follicular Spacing (Sick et al. 2006 Saturating WNT/DKK Reaction-Diffusion PDE)" ;
        pk:phenomenonScaleTier "6_organ_mm" ;
