        dct:description "Vendors and SHA-256-verifies the CC BY 2.5 dorsal whole-mount micrograph of Schmidtea mediterranea (`datasets/planarian_hk_atpase_anterior/schmidtea_mediterranea_specimen.jpg`), automatically segments the body contour (length 1478 px, aspect ratio 3.72) and bilateral photoreceptor ocelli (`segment_planarian_specimen`, L446-528: N = 2 eyespots at x/L = 0.0492 and 0.0563, mean x/L = 0.0528 matching the simulated anterior head domain), and reconstructs 2D body-plan silhouettes with eyespots for 1H1T, 2H0T, and 0H2T regenerates (Panels B3, C1, C2)." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-specimen-match> ;
