            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-brodland-differential-interfacial-tension-sorting-parameter-expressivity-3> ;
        ns1:hasScore 9.2e-01 ;
        ns1:hasVerdict "faithful" .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-brodland-differential-interfacial-tension-sorting-repro-package> a ns1:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Brodland (2002) / Krieg et al. (2008) / Maître et al. (2012) Differential Interfacial Tension Hypothesis (DITH) and zebrafish germ-layer cortical tension sorting, with time-dependent Nodal/TGF-beta coupling (Pass 3) — Reproducibility package: 92/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Deterministic RNG (seed 2008 everywhere, L450, L637, L788); `--self-test` runs 13 checks in ~13 s (L1704-L1810) including SHA-256 integrity, Lean-parity tension values, Young-Dupré bounds, the three static regimes, 3-layer stratification, specimen correlation, two-run bitwise determinism of both the static and the Nodal-coupled sorter, the Nodal dose map, the closure inequality, the relaxation invariant, the shield-stage tier counts and the Nodal-null control, and the 13-measurement contract; the default render regenerates the PNG and both GIFs in ~12 s with the printed summary (L1836-L1871). Deductions: no requirements lock file is vendored for this slot, the environment block above is the venv at audit time (-4); without MPLCONFIGDIR set matplotlib writes a font cache outside the repository and prints warnings (-2); PNG byte-identity across runs was not asserted (-2)." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-repro-package> ;
        ns1:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        ns1:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/repro-package" ;
        ns1:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-brodland-differential-interfacial-tension-sorting-repro-package-1>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-brodland-differential-interfacial-tension-sorting-repro-package-2> ;
        ns1:hasScore 9.2e-01 ;
        ns1:hasVerdict "faithful" .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-brodland-differential-interfacial-tension-sorting-source-traceability> a ns1:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Brodland (2002) / Krieg et al. (2008) / Maître et al. (2012) Differential Interfacial Tension Hypothesis (DITH) and zebrafish germ-layer cortical tension sorting, with time-dependent Nodal/TGF-beta coupling (Pass 3) — Source and data traceability: 90/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "`datasets/differential_interfacial_tension_sorting/` carries the SHA-256-pinned specimen (verified at runtime, L112-L130), a reference JSON with 12 sources, the regime table, Young-Dupré checkpoints and a new `nodal_tgfb_cortical_tension_coupling_pass3` block that lists every Nodal parameter and its literature anchor with an explicit status (standard / experimental design / approximate recalled / qualitative), 12 BibTeX entries, a README with the formulas and a reduction disclosure, and the scout manifest. Pass 3 corrected the v2 heterotypic adhesion entries that contradicted the gamma_het = 30 anchor. Deductions: the 7 Pass 3 DOIs were recorded offline and are flagged `doi_verification: not resolved` in the JSON (-5); the key quantitative anchors (5 tiers, tiers 1-2 endoderm) are recalled, not digitised from the cited figures (-3); the Krieg AFM values 50/95/130 pN/um are carried from v2 without a figure/table pin (-2)." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-source-traceability> ;
