        ns1:hasVerdict "faithful" .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-spiral-dislocation-terraces-model-fidelity> a ns1:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Cartwright & Checa (2007) & Cartwright et al. (2009) nacre screw-dislocation spirals, Frank-Read target terraces, defect pair annihilation, chitin-membrane perforation bridges and aragonite twin polygonization — Model fidelity to source: 88/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Gibbs-Thomson v(r) = v_inf (1 - r_c / r) and the BCF/Cabrera-Levine spiral kinematics are the source's (`compute_bcf_spiral_kinematics`, L189-222; `gibbs_thomson_step_velocity`, L224-236), and the Pass 3 additions are genuine model components: a driven Allen-Cahn perforation field with the correct double-well derivative and spinodal threshold S_crit = S_0 + 1/(3 beta) (L713, L765-767), a footprint slaved to the eikonal terrace tier (L736), and a direction-dependent step speed with crystallographic e_2 and a three-domain twin average (L545-552) entering every regime's travel function (L319-321, L338-340, L354-356). Deductions: the terrace fields are closed-form Cabrera-Levine phases and the subcritical/supercritical switch is an `if` on d <= 2 r_c (L308), with `activity` only gating the height field (L337, L344) — the docstring's 'eikonal solver' is kinematic, not a propagated front (-5); the gastropod tower lattice in `simulate_nacre_architecture_3d` is a hard-coded template (pitch_tower = 3.6071, tower_spacing = 11.5, hex_mod = 1 + 0.06 cos 6 theta, L497-510), not an output of the eikonal or membrane model (-4); the membrane model is 2D-per-sheet with the bridge site taken as argmax of early phi (L776-777) and tuning choices n_pores >= 1 (L742), eroded-interior seeding (L745) and a fixed A_g ~ 1/sigma^2 bridge budget (L727-728) (-3)." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
        ns1:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
        ns1:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
        ns1:evidenceAgainst "2007-cartwright-nacre-spiral-dislocation-terraces.py L496–L512: Gastropod tower lattice is a hard-coded presentation template (pitch_tower, tower_spacing, hex_mod), not driven by the eikonal or membrane model <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/e651a8b8/2007-cartwright-nacre-spiral-dislocation-terraces.py#L496-L512>" ;
        ns1:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-spiral-dislocation-terraces-model-fidelity-1>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-spiral-dislocation-terraces-model-fidelity-2>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-spiral-dislocation-terraces-model-fidelity-3>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-spiral-dislocation-terraces-model-fidelity-4>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-spiral-dislocation-terraces-model-fidelity-5> ;
        ns1:hasScore 8.8e-01 ;
        ns1:hasVerdict "faithful" .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-spiral-dislocation-terraces-morphometric-validation> a ns1:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Cartwright & Checa (2007) & Cartwright et al. (2009) nacre screw-dislocation spirals, Frank-Read target terraces, defect pair annihilation, chitin-membrane perforation bridges and aragonite twin polygonization — Morphometric validation: 80/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "`measure_morphoeval()` (L1666-1835) now returns 15 reference-anchored measurements, and the Pass 3 ones are honest: raw spiral pitch 7.8007 vs 7.9736 um (L1715-1722, blend removed), columnar offset 0.000 vs 0 (L1775-1783), sheet offset 0.215 vs nominal 0.5 with the under-prediction stated (L1785-1793), sweep transition 0.125 vs the model-analytic 0.121 (L1795-1803), f_2/f_6 vs analytic (L1805-1823), twin angle parity (L1825-1833), and the SEM h_0 method string now carries the calibration caveat (L1748). Deductions: measurements 1-3 (L1684-1713) regress against a 12-species table whose lambda_obs/omega_obs are within ~1 % of the BCF law for every species and are untraceable to any measured table, so r = 0.9999 is circular (-8); measurements 7-9 depend on a calibration anchored to the reference value, only CV and aspect ratio being calibration-independent (-4); measurements 13-14 reproduce the analytic f_2/f_6 to 4 digits because T^-1 is nearly linear at the measured ring, validating the implementation more than the physics (-3); measurement 12's reference is the model's own analytic threshold (-2); the sheet-mode offset misses the nominal 0.5 by 2.7 SD (-3); no morphometric compares the model to a literature bridge-offset or tablet-polygonality measurement (e.g. Checa et al. 2011) (-3). Offsetting credit for the honest 2 % raw-pitch deficit and field-counted terrace numbers (7/6/13 vs refs 6/6/12)." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
        ns1:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
        ns1:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
        ns1:evidenceAgainst "datasets/nacre_spiral_dislocation_terraces/nacre_spiral_dislocation_terraces_reference.json L78–L89: 12-species lambda_obs_um / omega_obs_rad_hr within ~1 % of lambda_pred for every species; not traceable to a measured table <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/e651a8b8/datasets/nacre_spiral_dislocation_terraces/nacre_spiral_dislocation_terraces_reference.json#L78-L89>" ;
        ns1:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-spiral-dislocation-terraces-measurement-12-species-bcf-spiral-terrace-pitch-correlation-cartwright-checa-2007-bcf-1951>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-spiral-dislocation-terraces-measurement-12-species-spiral-angular-rotation-frequency-correlation-omega-omega-0-v-inf-r-c>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-spiral-dislocation-terraces-measurement-aragonite-110-cyclic-twin-retention-of-6-fold-pseudo-hexagonal-polygonization-f-6-measured-on-anisotropic-eikonal-terrace-ring>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-spiral-dislocation-terraces-measurement-aragonite-110-cyclic-twin-suppression-of-2-fold-terrace-elongation-f-2-measured-on-anisotropic-eikonal-terrace-ring>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-spiral-dislocation-terraces-measurement-aragonite-110-twin-angle-2-atan-a-b-from-de-villiers-1971-lattice-parameters>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-spiral-dislocation-terraces-measurement-bivalve-sheet-nacre-pteria-hirundo-brick-wall-mineral-bridge-stacking-offset-d-tab-from-random-pore-membrane-perforation>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-spiral-dislocation-terraces-measurement-bivalve-sheet-nacre-pteria-hirundo-single-spiral-terrace-pitch-lambda-0>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-spiral-dislocation-terraces-measurement-columnar-gastropod-nacre-haliotis-rufescens-mineral-bridge-stacking-offset-c-k-c-k-1-d-tab-from-stacked-sheet-allen-cahn-membrane-perforation>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-spiral-dislocation-terraces-measurement-columnar-to-sheet-stacking-transition-bridge-localisation-sigma-d-tab-at-which-the-mean-offset-first-exceeds-0-1-d-tab>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-spiral-dislocation-terraces-measurement-empirical-bcf-terrace-pitch-to-critical-radius-slope-lambda-0-r-c>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-spiral-dislocation-terraces-measurement-same-chirality-b-b-double-spiral-to-single-spiral-terrace-pitch-ratio>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-spiral-dislocation-terraces-measurement-sem-specimen-aragonite-tablet-width-to-thickness-aspect-ratio-d-tab-h-0-nacre-aragonite-tablets-specimen-jpg>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-spiral-dislocation-terraces-measurement-sem-specimen-inter-lamellar-spacing-coefficient-of-variation-cv-nacre-aragonite-tablets-specimen-jpg>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-spiral-dislocation-terraces-measurement-sem-specimen-segmented-inter-lamellar-aragonite-tablet-thickness-h-0-nacre-aragonite-tablets-specimen-jpg>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-spiral-dislocation-terraces-measurement-subcritical-frank-read-dipole-negative-control-active-terraces-d-0-60-um-2-r-c-0-84-um>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-spiral-dislocation-terraces-morphometric-validation-1>,
