        ns1:evidenceAgainst "datasets/mollusc_shell_marginal_buckling/mollusc_shell_marginal_buckling_reference.json L65–L149: default_parameters.EI_mN_mm2 = 0.180 (L65) and Adult_V EI = 1.79131 (L136) disagree with the script's hard-coded 1.085; only the back-fitted Pecten row (L149) matches <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/e651a8b8/datasets/mollusc_shell_marginal_buckling/mollusc_shell_marginal_buckling_reference.json#L65-L149>",
            "morphoeval/cloud/dispatches/slot-072.json L25–L25: slug 'cahn-hilliard-biosilica' — slot metadata names the wrong paper/organism for this script <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/e651a8b8/morphoeval/cloud/dispatches/slot-072.json#L25-L25>" ;
        ns1:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-chirat-mollusc-shell-marginal-buckling-source-traceability-1>,
