    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-model-fidelity> a ns1:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Forterre et al. (2005) Nature Doubly-Curved Shallow Shell Elastic Energy & Saddle-Node Cusp Catastrophe in Dionaea muscipula, coupled to a P1-FEM trigger-hair action potential and Ca2+ counting gate — Model fidelity to source: 82/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "The Pass 2 shell model is intact: shallow-shell energy with Gauss stretching penalty (`gauss_stretching_energy` L231-244, `doubly_curved_shell_energy` L246-263), cusp fold metrics (L334-370) and RK45 coupled snap dynamics (`simulate_coupled_snap_dynamics` L373-451). Pass 3 adds a genuine, verified reduced electrophysiology layer: P1 FEM assembly (grad-grad stiffness + lumped mass, L778-796), IMEX FitzHugh-Nagumo solver with implicit diffusion via `splu` (L798-873), planar front speed within 2.5 % of the exact Nagumo formula (L725-731) and the two-touch Ca2+ gate on the rest curvature (L993-1067), backed by 5 Lean 4 theorems (0 sorrys). Deductions: `relax_shell_equilibrium_2d` minimises `((kx+ky)/2)^2 - k_init^2)^2` (L300, L307) while the energy/gradient/dynamics use the Gauss product `(kx*ky - k_init^2)^2` — two different functionals, and its `barrier_energy` (L330) is the closed-form cusp expression, not derived from the minimisation (-6); the electrics are solved on a flat planform with no curvature feedback and FitzHugh-Nagumo stands in for the multi-channel Ca2+/Cl-/K+ AP (-5); the motor response is a scalar gate A(t) on a two-mode shell, not a turgor/curvature field (-4); the 0-D hair mechanics has no lever/podium geometry (-3)." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
        ns1:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
        ns1:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
        ns1:evidenceAgainst "2005-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling.py L282–L333: relax_shell_equilibrium_2d minimises a mean-curvature functional ((kx+ky)/2)^2 at L300/L307 — inconsistent with the dynamics; barrier_energy at L330 is closed-form <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/de27b685/2005-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling.py#L282-L333>" ;
        ns1:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-model-fidelity-1>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-model-fidelity-2>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-model-fidelity-3>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-model-fidelity-4>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-model-fidelity-5>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-model-fidelity-6> ;
        ns1:hasScore 8.2e-01 ;
        ns1:hasVerdict "faithful" .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-morphometric-validation> a ns1:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Forterre et al. (2005) Nature Doubly-Curved Shallow Shell Elastic Energy & Saddle-Node Cusp Catastrophe in Dionaea muscipula, coupled to a P1-FEM trigger-hair action potential and Ca2+ counting gate — Morphometric validation: 72/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "`measure_morphoeval()` (L1680-1873) now returns 17 measurements. The genuinely validating ones are the FEM-vs-exact-Nagumo strip speed (9.55 vs 9.80 cm/s, measurement 10), the diffusivity exponent 0.496 vs 0.5 (12), and the emergent FEM-vs-0-D threshold elevation (14); the lobe speed 8.35 cm/s (11) and AP duration 1.55 s (13) land in the recalled literature ranges. Deductions: measurements 3-6 report r = 1.0000 / RMSE = 0.0000 against `*_obs` columns produced by the same analytic/ODE model (circular) and Panel C labels them \"Forterre et al. (2005) ref\" (L1316) (-10); measurements 8-9 compare with self-recorded values (L1776, L1786) (-5); measurement 14 (F_min 3.00 vs 2.9 µN) is parameter-driven because `TRIGGER_HAIR_F_HALF_UN` = 2.9 (L683) is set at the literature threshold, and measurement 17 (24.8 s) is fixed by `CA_INCREMENT_PER_AP`/`CA_DECAY_TAU_S` (L696-697) — the self-test checks sweep/analytic consistency, not the literature 30 s (-6); the latency reference 0.3 s (16) is soft and dominated by the inherited `tau_active` = 0.18 s (-3); all new reference values are `literature-approx`, not digitised figures (-4)." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
        ns1:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
        ns1:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
        ns1:evidenceAgainst "2005-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling.py L1316–L1317: Panel C legend labels model-generated points 'Forterre et al. (2005) ref'; Stage II shading hard-coded 0.21-0.30 s <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/de27b685/2005-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling.py#L1316-L1317>",
            "2005-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling.py L1722–L1760: Measurements 3-6: r = 1.0000 against *_obs columns generated by the same model (circular) <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/de27b685/2005-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling.py#L1722-L1760>",
            "2005-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling.py L683–L700: Model constants (F_half = 2.9 µN, D, tau_v, c_Ca, tau_Ca) chosen so threshold, speed and memory window land in the recalled literature ranges <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/de27b685/2005-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling.py#L683-L700>" ;
        ns1:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-measurement-bistable-equilibrium-curvature-kappa-eq-alpha-kappa-init-correlation-across-alpha-in-0-2-5-0>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-measurement-coupled-2d-snap-peak-speed-correlation-across-alpha-in-0-2-5-0>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-measurement-cusp-catastrophe-saddle-node-fold-locus-kx0-fold-alpha-kappa-init-correlation-across-alpha-in-0-2-5-0>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-measurement-dionaea-muscipula-specimen-bilateral-lobe-symmetry-index-across-central-midrib-dionaea-muscipula-trap-lobe-specimen-jpg>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-measurement-dionaea-muscipula-specimen-marginal-cilia-tooth-angular-spacing-cv-dionaea-muscipula-trap-lobe-specimen-jpg>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-measurement-fem-action-potential-half-amplitude-duration-at-lobe-probe-nodes>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-measurement-fem-conduction-velocity-scaling-exponent-v-d-p-across-electrotonic-diffusivity-ablation-sweep>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-measurement-fem-lobe-action-potential-conduction-velocity-from-trigger-hair-across-dionaea-lobe-planform>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-measurement-flat-pass-gaussian-stretching-energy-barrier-u-stretch-0-0-at-adult-alpha-3-0>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-measurement-forterre-et-al-2005-critical-cusp-catastrophe-coupling-threshold-alpha-c-nu-0-28>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-measurement-p1-fem-planar-action-potential-conduction-velocity-vs-exact-nagumo-front-speed-strip-benchmark>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-measurement-single-touch-one-action-potential-final-shell-curvature-kappa-x-kappa-init-no-closure-control>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-measurement-surgical-curvature-relief-strip-ablation-energy-barrier-delta-u-l-eff-l-3>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-measurement-three-stage-closure-kinematics-trajectory-kappa-x-t-kappa-init-correlation-alpha-3-0>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-measurement-trigger-hair-all-or-none-ap-initiation-threshold-force-in-fem-lobe-rushton-liminal-length-effect>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-measurement-two-touch-counting-short-term-memory-window-longest-inter-touch-interval-that-still-snaps>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-measurement-two-touch-delta-10-s-snap-latency-from-second-trigger-hair-touch-to-peak-snap-speed>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-morphometric-validation-1>,
