    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-haupaix-avian-plumage-somite-stripes-source-traceability> a ns1:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Haupaix et al. (2018), Inaba et al. (2019) & Lin et al. (2013) somite-prepatterned Agouti signaling, melanocyte gap-junction reaction-diffusion and feather-follicle ring-niche chevrons in galliform plumage stripes — Source and data traceability: 82/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "All four primary sources now resolve: Haupaix (2018) and Inaba (2019) carry the published titles, venues, DOIs and PMIDs after Pass 3 corrected a fabricated title and a non-existent Science article; the bib and JSON were re-pinned and the four SHA-256 locks are verified fail-closed at runtime (L113-L146); the new `pass3_provenance_flags` block states which numbers are not from the papers. Deductions: the model is still calibrated to those unsourced numbers (species mm widths, Lambda = 0.95 mm, bead regimes) (-8); `scout_manifest.json` was not re-audited and may carry the old citations (-3); Lin (2013) and Bailleul (2019) have no PMID recorded (-2); no paper figure or supplementary table is vendored (-5)." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-source-traceability> ;
