    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-jonsson-auxin-pin1-meristem-specimen-match> a ns1:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Jönsson et al. (2006) & Smith et al. (2006) up-the-gradient PIN1 polarization with explicit PIN1 trafficking kinetics, quasi-3D subepidermal canalization, and polar auxin transport for shoot apical meristem phyllotaxis — Morphological realism / specimen match: 74/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Judged on the regenerated PNG and GIF: Panel A shows PIN1 polarity vectors converging on discrete auxin maxima in a hexagonal L1 lattice, visually consistent with Heisler 2005 / Jönsson Fig. 3 convergence points; Panel H shows a single-file strand of high auxin with PIN1 polarised downward from the source to the sink, resembling the midvein strand of Bayer 2009 Fig. 3 and Scarpella 2006 PIN1::GFP files; Panel F overlays 410 detected leaf tips and the rosette mask on the Aeonium specimen with 12/12 sector coverage; the GIF shows the strand canalizing over 240 h. Deductions: the convergence pattern in Panel A is imposed by the seeded envelope, so its resemblance to live-imaging data is not evidence for the model (-8); the specimen is a Crassulaceae rosette, not an Arabidopsis meristem, and no PIN1 immunolocalization or provascular-strand image is vendored for side-by-side comparison of Panels A, G or H (-10); the parastichy spiral overlays in Panel F are fixed curves (L1348-1353), not fitted to the detected tips (-4); the Panel D wild-type profile is hand-drawn (-4)." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-specimen-match> ;
        ns1:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        ns1:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/specimen-match" ;
        ns1:evidenceAgainst "2006-jonsson-auxin-pin1-meristem.py L1346–L1354: Parastichy 'overlay' curves phi = 5.2 t and -3.4 t + 1.1 are hard-coded, not fitted to the detected leaf tips <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2006-jonsson-auxin-pin1-meristem.py#L1346-L1354>",
            "datasets/auxin_pin1_phyllotaxis/README.md L1–L20: Only specimen is a top-down Aeonium rosette; no Arabidopsis SAM PIN1 image or strand image is vendored <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/datasets/auxin_pin1_phyllotaxis/README.md#L1-L20>" ;
        ns1:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-jonsson-auxin-pin1-meristem-specimen-match-1>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-jonsson-auxin-pin1-meristem-specimen-match-2>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-jonsson-auxin-pin1-meristem-specimen-match-3> ;
        ns1:hasScore 7.4e-01 ;
        ns1:hasVerdict "mostly faithful" .

