    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening-code-traceability> a ns1:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Armon et al. (2011) Science / Efrati et al. (2009) JMPS Incompatible Shell Elasticity & Chiral Seed Pod Opening — Code-to-model traceability: 92/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "The module header maps Laws 1-5 to the Lean theorems and to Armon 2011 / Efrati 2009 / Freund 1990 / Vogel 2005 (L1-74), and each Pass 3 function docstring states its equation and Lean link (`bending_energy_prefactor` L733-741 derives B_eff from the Efrati bending content; `freund_crack_speed` L783-790; `elastic_catapult_seed_speed` L861-879). The math-KG registration lists equations 4-5 with single-range `code_locus`, `code_locus_secondary` and `lean_locus`. Deductions: the file name `2007-liang-...` and sim_id `liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening` do not match the seed paper (Armon et al. 2011) — a campaign-level identity mismatch that propagates into every audit, KG and run id (-3); the Lean theorems are Int-linear abstractions (scaled Freund speed c_R (G - Gamma), eta Delta_U partition), not statements about the ODE integration or the minimizer (-2); the \"Eq. 3 & SOM\" and \"p. 1726-1727\" pinpoints are unverified and the heuristic choices (v_arrest_frac, m/3, h_suture = h) are documented in docstrings but not traced to a source (-3)." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
        ns1:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        ns1:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
        ns1:evidenceAgainst "morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_065_chiral_seed_pod_opening.lean L126–L149: freund_scaled_crack_speed is c_R (G - Gamma) over Int — an abstraction of the law, not of integrate_suture_crack <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/45670cb8/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_065_chiral_seed_pod_opening.lean#L126-L149>" ;
        ns1:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening-code-traceability-1>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening-code-traceability-2>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening-code-traceability-3> ;
        ns1:hasScore 9.2e-01 ;
        ns1:hasVerdict "faithful" .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening-model-fidelity> a ns1:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Armon et al. (2011) Science / Efrati et al. (2009) JMPS Incompatible Shell Elasticity & Chiral Seed Pod Opening — Model fidelity to source: 90/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "The incompatible-plate core is unchanged and credited (saddle b_0 with det(b_0) = -kappa_0^2 < 0, `compute_target_curvature_tensor` L174-209; FvK critical width L210-217; L-BFGS-B minimizer of U(H, D, phi; w_tilde) L278-416). Pass 3 adds a physically coherent reduced coupling: B_eff derived from the Efrati bending content (L733-741), Delta_e -> G (L743-776), Freund's equation of motion with arrest (L783-790, L807-859), drying-driven Griffith initiation and stick-slip in `simulate_suture_fracture_ballistic_ejection` (L932-1097), and energy-partition ballistics (L861-879, L889-931), each with a negative control and backed by 2 new Lean theorems. Deductions: the pitchfork threshold is prescribed, not emergent — Lambda is normalised by (w_tilde/w_tilde_c)^4 (L324-325) so the bifurcation occurs at w_tilde_c by construction (-3); after the minimizer, H is forced to 0 for w_tilde <= w_tilde_c, its sign is forced to `branch`, and phi is snapped to 0 (L362-366), so the reported branch structure is partly post-processed (-3); e_init = kappa_0^2 assumes a perfectly flat closed valve (upper bound on stored energy, L753-756), the crack area assumes h_suture = h, c_R uses the bulk shear speed not plate waves (L778-781), and m_eff = m_seg/3 is a cantilever heuristic (L871-875) — no flexural or snap-through dynamics of the coiling valve are simulated (-4)." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
        ns1:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        ns1:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
        ns1:evidenceAgainst "2007-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening.py L278–L416: L-BFGS-B minimizer of the reduced non-Euclidean energy; Lambda normalised by (w_tilde/w_tilde_c)^4 at L324-325 and H/branch/phi post-processing at L362-366 make the pitchfork partly prescribed <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/45670cb8/2007-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening.py#L278-L416>" ;
        ns1:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening-model-fidelity-1>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening-model-fidelity-2>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening-model-fidelity-3>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening-model-fidelity-4>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening-model-fidelity-5> ;
        ns1:hasScore 9e-01 ;
        ns1:hasVerdict "faithful" .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening-morphometric-validation> a ns1:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Armon et al. (2011) Science / Efrati et al. (2009) JMPS Incompatible Shell Elasticity & Chiral Seed Pod Opening — Morphometric validation: 72/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "`measure_morphoeval()` (L1779-1944) now returns 15 measurements with references, uncertainties and tests, and the Pass 3 negative controls (kappa_0 = 0, Gamma_c >= G, achiral rings) behave correctly. Deductions are large because the remediation exposed that most references are not empirical: measurements 3-7 compare the minimizer against the `*_obs` columns of chiral_seed_pod_opening_reference.json (L48-59, L61-68), which are analytical values of the same reduced model (H_obs = (1 - nu)/2 sqrt(1 - (w_tilde_c/w_tilde)^4), tau_obs = D sin 2theta), so r = 1.0000 is self-consistency, not validation against Armon 2011 Figs. 3-4 (-10); measurement 9 uses `reference_value: 0.24` (L1877) that is the script's own computed CV 0.2405 (-4); of the six Pass 3 measurements, #10's reference is the model Gamma_c (L1888), #11's is the analytical self-estimate -tau ln(1 - sqrt(Gamma/G)) (L1898), #12's is the Freund law itself, #13's is a qualitative \"complete dehiscence\" 1.0, #14's 10 m/s is Cardamine (L1928; Bauhinia predicted 3.6x lower), and #15's is the drag-free bound (L1938) — consistency checks, not empirical morphometrics (-8). The 4-system pitch correlation (r = 0.9994) and the specimen lobe segmentation remain the only comparisons to numbers that originate outside the script." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
        ns1:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        ns1:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
        ns1:evidenceAgainst "2007-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening.py L1779–L1944: 15 measurements with RMSE/p-values/CV; references for #3-7 are analytic model values, #9 is the script's own CV, #10-15 are model/theory/transfer references <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/45670cb8/2007-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening.py#L1779-L1944>",
            "datasets/chiral_seed_pod_opening/chiral_seed_pod_opening_reference.json L48–L68: Width and cutting-angle sweep *_obs columns are analytical values of the reduced model, not digitised Armon 2011 figure points <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/45670cb8/datasets/chiral_seed_pod_opening/chiral_seed_pod_opening_reference.json#L48-L68>",
            "datasets/chiral_seed_pod_opening/suture_fracture_ballistic_reference.json L54–L75: Transfer-boundary benchmarks: Cardamine ~10 m/s and Hura ~70 m/s, recalled values not digitised; no Bauhinia datum <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/45670cb8/datasets/chiral_seed_pod_opening/suture_fracture_ballistic_reference.json#L54-L75>" ;
        ns1:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening-measurement-4-system-legume-biomimetic-latex-helical-pitch-p-correlation-bauhinia-erythrina-latex>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening-measurement-achiral-ring-negative-control-helical-pitch-p-at-cutting-angle-theta-0-deg>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening-measurement-armon-et-al-2011-critical-f-ppl-von-k-rm-n-pitchfork-width-w-tilde-c-nu-0-30>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening-measurement-bauhinia-variegata-specimen-segmented-helical-lobe-half-pitch-cv-bauhinia-chiral-seed-pod-specimen-jpg>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening-measurement-cutting-angle-chirality-torsion-tau-theta-kappa-0-correlation-across-theta-in-0-deg-90-deg>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening-measurement-dimensionless-helical-pitch-p-w-tilde-kappa-0-2-pi-transition-correlation-across-w-tilde>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening-measurement-dimensionless-helix-radius-r-w-tilde-kappa-0-transition-correlation-across-w-tilde-c>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening-measurement-drying-coupled-stick-slip-pod-opening-fraction-a-l-and-cumulative-dynamic-crack-run-time-gamma-c-120-j-m-2>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening-measurement-elastic-catapult-seed-launch-speed-v-seed-drying-coupled-mean-over-ejected-seeds>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening-measurement-freund-dynamic-crack-speed-law-v-c-r-1-gamma-c-g-across-the-7-point-suture-toughness-sweep-homogeneous-suture-fully-dried>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening-measurement-griffith-initiation-time-t-c-of-suture-dehiscence-on-the-desiccation-curve-kappa-0-t-kappa-0-f-1-exp-t-tau-dry>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening-measurement-incompatible-saddle-gaussian-target-curvature-det-b-0-kappa-0-2-kappa-0-0-42-cm-1>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening-measurement-seed-ballistic-range-with-quadratic-drag-from-a-3-m-launch-height-45-deg>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening-measurement-supercritical-pitchfork-mean-curvature-h-w-tilde-kappa-0-correlation-across-w-tilde-in-0-5-10>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening-measurement-suture-energy-release-rate-g-final-delta-e-kappa-0-0-42-w-h-from-the-quasi-static-minimizer-fully-dried-pod>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening-morphometric-validation-1> ;
