        dct:description "13-check `run_self_test()` suite (L2057-L2185, ~30 s) verifying SHA-256 integrity, thin-shell and Kirsch laws, PIN1 flux conservation, perturbation controls, Voronoi volume identity vs ConvexHull, mesh mechanics and Law 4 numerics, division-plane orthogonality and Law 5 numerics plus geometric-rule comparison, mesh-coupled ODE, specimen profile comparison, the 18-measurement contract, and bitwise determinism of both the ODE and the mesh (`X_final` array equality). Default run regenerates the PNG and GIF in ~52 s with pinned seed 2008; mesh results are cached per argument tuple." ;
