    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-murray-mammalian-coat-markings-code-traceability> a ns1:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Murray (1981) Thomas substrate-inhibition reaction-diffusion pre-pattern, conical tail spot-to-ring transition & P1 surface-FEM felid body — Code-to-model traceability: 92/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "The module docstring (L1-76) lists every Pass 3 change, the v2 defects it corrects, the equations of Murray (1981) Sections 2 and 4, Liu et al. (2006) and the five Lean theorems; each solver docstring cites its source; the isolated Math KG spec registers five laws with Lean declarations, Lean loci and current code loci (`murray-mammalian-coat-markings.yaml`, 5 equations); and the Lean file documents why each theorem is the formal twin of a numerical check (Theorem 4 <-> self-test 10, Theorem 5 <-> exclusion-zone diagnostics)." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
        ns1:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
