        ns1:evidenceAgainst "1975-richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling.py L1850–L1893: CLI: --skip-3d, --subdivisions, --seed reach the 3D surrogate; --growth-g/--h-cortex/--mu-ratio/--R-brain overrides are passed only to render_comparison_figure <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/45670cb8/1975-richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling.py#L1850-L1893>",
            "datasets/cortical_gyrification_folding/cortical_gyrification_folding_reference.json L245–L254: lissencephaly_thick_cortex has g = 1.14 < g_c = 1.18, so h = 6.50 mm never influences the result <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/45670cb8/datasets/cortical_gyrification_folding/cortical_gyrification_folding_reference.json#L245-L254>" ;
        ns1:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling-parameter-expressivity-1>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling-parameter-expressivity-2> ;
