    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves-code-traceability> a ns1:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Sharon et al. (2002) Nature / Audoly & Boudaoud (2003) PRL Non-Euclidean Edge Buckling Cascades in Ruffled Leaf Margins — Code-to-model traceability: 93/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "The module header (L1-L70) maps every law to its source and to the Lean 4 theorem that formalises it, the developmental section is introduced with its own Lean cross-reference (L737) and `pin1_up_the_gradient_transport` names `pin_pairwise_transport_mass_conservation` in its docstring (L781); `morphoeval/math_kg_loops/sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves.yaml` registers 5 equations with single-range `code_locus` / `lean_locus` pins re-pointed to the shifted Pass 3 line numbers; self-test comments name the Lean theorem being exercised (L1844, L1861). Deductions: the fixed mode phases (L401, L1024), the 0.18 in-plane contraction factor (L415) and the 6 mm edge-displacement decay (L1033) carry no citation (-3); the ordinal-check thresholds and the half-max primary/secondary split (L933-L940) are documented but not sourced (-2); measurement 12's `reference_source` cites Sharon 2002 Fig. 1c for a serration range that figure does not quantify (-2)." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
        ns1:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        ns1:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
        ns1:evidenceAgainst "2002-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves.py L401–L415: Fixed mode phases and 0.18 in-plane contraction factor in the 3D mesh are unsourced <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/327729c8/2002-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves.py#L401-L415>" ;
        ns1:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves-code-traceability-1>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves-code-traceability-2>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves-code-traceability-3> ;
        ns1:hasScore 9.3e-01 ;
        ns1:hasVerdict "faithful" .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves-model-fidelity> a ns1:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Sharon et al. (2002) Nature / Audoly & Boudaoud (2003) PRL Non-Euclidean Edge Buckling Cascades in Ruffled Leaf Margins — Model fidelity to source: 93/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "The Pass 2 metric / curvature / wavelength laws (`compute_target_metric_and_curvature`, L151-L195; `compute_local_wavelength_profile`, L197-L211) are faithful to Sharon 2002 / Audoly & Boudaoud 2003 and the new developmental module is a recognisable, honestly-labelled reduction of Nath 2003 / Bilsborough 2011 / Smith-Jönsson 2006: basipetal TCP front (L766-L774), exactly mass-conserving up-the-gradient PIN1 exchange with no-flux ends (L776-L797), CUC2 gating, growth dilution and a growing Lagrangian lattice whose strain ratio gives g_0(y,t) (L805-L1012), with the FvK cascade genuinely re-solved on the developmental <g_0> (L962-L964) and 6 Lean 4 theorems (0 sorrys) covering Laws 1-5. Deductions: the Pass 2 `relax_foppl_von_karman_cascade` (L230-L367) is a surrogate energy whose target slope s_target (L307), aspect constant 1/sqrt(3) (L283), penetration targets 1.5/r_cascade * lambda_m (L253), cutoff 4.65 t (L280) and hard Gamma < 120 gate (L302) are tuned so the output matches the reference table — wavelength and penetration r = 1.0000 are inputs, not predictions (-4); the gene network is 1D along the margin with no 2D sheet mechanics, no stress feedback on PIN1 polarity and no cell division, and serration outgrowth ds/dt = k_s a (1-m) is kinematic bookkeeping rather than an elastic in-plane growth solution (-2); the Hosta saddle fallback `lmin_s = 39.70` (L592) equals the reference value (-1)." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
        ns1:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        ns1:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
        ns1:evidenceAgainst "2002-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves.py L230–L367: Surrogate L-BFGS-B FvK cascade relaxation: s_target (L307), c_aspect = 1/sqrt(3) (L283), penetration targets (L253), cutoff 4.65 t (L280), Gamma < 120 gate (L302) are prescribed so the output reproduces the reference table <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/327729c8/2002-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves.py#L230-L367>",
            "2002-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves.py L592–L592: Hard-coded Hosta saddle fallback lmin_s = 39.70 equals the reference value (circular) <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/327729c8/2002-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves.py#L592-L592>" ;
        ns1:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves-model-fidelity-1>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves-model-fidelity-2>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves-model-fidelity-3>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves-model-fidelity-4> ;
        ns1:hasScore 9.3e-01 ;
        ns1:hasVerdict "faithful" .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves-morphometric-validation> a ns1:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Sharon et al. (2002) Nature / Audoly & Boudaoud (2003) PRL Non-Euclidean Edge Buckling Cascades in Ruffled Leaf Margins — Morphometric validation: 90/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "`measure_morphoeval()` (L1616-L1785) now returns 15 reference-anchored measurements: the 9 Pass 2 metrics (A_m/lambda_m = 0.1468 vs 0.1461, r_cascade 3.5, edge-amplitude r = 1.0000, K(0) = -0.001091 mm^-2, lambda_loc r = 1.0000, self-similar collapse r = 1.0000, flat-metric negative control, 4-system r_aspect = 0.9992, specimen cascade ratio 4.75) plus 6 developmental ones (WT <g_0> = 0.6059; cin/WT = 2.10; N_ser = 27; knockout control = 0; hierarchy ratio 3.99; ordinal agreement 1.0). Deductions, applied because the new measurements mostly validate against targets that are not independent data: measurement 10's reference g_0 = 0.64 is the Pass 2 mechanical module's own Lactuca value and gamma_0 = 0.0085/h, beta = 0.75 (L828-L829) were tuned to land near it (-3); measurement 11's reference 1.5 is a declared placeholder for '> 1' (L1646), measurement 12's reference 22.5 is the midpoint of a plausibility range [5, 40] (L1656) and measurement 14's reference 3.5 is a cross-module consistency check against r_cascade (L1676) — only measurements 13 and 15 have crisp literature targets (-4); the serration spacing 2.19 mm is set by D_a, T_pin, kappa, mu_a (L812-L816) chosen for robust patterning, so N_ser = 27 is not evidence (-2); the Pass 2 wavelength / penetration r = 1.0000 are by construction (L250) and the reference table's G1-G4 / 9-station values are analytic rather than digitised from Sharon 2002 Fig. 3 (-1 net, partly already priced in v2). Credit: every new measurement states in `reference_source` exactly which of these caveats applies." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
        ns1:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        ns1:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
        ns1:evidenceAgainst "2002-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves.py L1630–L1640: Measurement 10: WT <g_0> = 0.6059 vs target 0.64 — reference_source flags it as the Pass 2 module's own value (self-consistency, not independent) <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/327729c8/2002-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves.py#L1630-L1640>",
            "2002-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves.py L1646–L1646: Measurement 11 reference_value 1.5 is a declared placeholder magnitude for the ordinal statement cin > WT <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/327729c8/2002-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves.py#L1646-L1646>",
            "2002-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves.py L1656–L1656: Measurement 12 reference = midpoint of a broad plausibility range [5, 40], not a digitised serration count <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/327729c8/2002-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves.py#L1656-L1656>",
            "2002-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves.py L1676–L1676: Measurement 14 reference 3.5 is a cross-module consistency check against the mechanical r_cascade, not empirical <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/327729c8/2002-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves.py#L1676-L1676>",
            "2002-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves.py L812–L816: Serration spacing set by D_a, T_pin, kappa, mu_a — chosen for robust patterning, not fitted to data <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/327729c8/2002-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves.py#L812-L816>" ;
        ns1:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves-measurement-4-system-taxon-plastic-sheet-edge-aspect-ratio-a-lambda-correlation>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves-measurement-audoly-boudaoud-2003-sub-harmonic-cascade-wavelength-ratio-r-cascade-lambda-m-lambda-m-1>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves-measurement-brioschi-intrinsic-gaussian-curvature-k-0-at-free-leaf-margin-g-0-0-64-ell-12-mm>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves-measurement-flat-euclidean-metric-negative-control-maximum-amplitude-max-a-m-at-g-0-0>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves-measurement-inward-distance-local-wavelength-scaling-lambda-loc-x-correlation-across-x-in-0-36-mm>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves-measurement-lactuca-sativa-lollo-bionda-specimen-empirical-cascade-frequency-ratio-n-fine-n-coarse-lactuca-sativa-edge-waves-specimen-jpg>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves-measurement-multi-generation-edge-amplitude-a-m-0-correlation-across-g1-g4>,
