            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sumper-diatom-frustule-phase-sep-measurement-sumper-2002-3-tier-pore-diameter-log-linear-scaling-correlation-foramen-cribrum-cribrella>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sumper-diatom-frustule-phase-sep-measurement-two-stage-hierarchical-quench-nested-cribrum-sub-pores-per-foramen>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sumper-diatom-frustule-phase-sep-morphometric-validation-1>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sumper-diatom-frustule-phase-sep-morphometric-validation-2> ;
