        ns1:evidenceAgainst "2022-tailbud-neuromesodermal-jamming.py L1478–L1601: Row C has no vendored specimen (no FN immunostain, no her1 in situ); comparisons are to approximate literature ratios and to the model's own Cooke-Zeeman S <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2022-tailbud-neuromesodermal-jamming.py#L1478-L1601>" ;
        ns1:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-tailbud-neuromesodermal-jamming-specimen-match-1>,
