        dct:description "All 12 sources carry DOIs (Summerbell 1974 a PMID, verified against PubMed) in the module docstring, `paper_citations.bib` (12 entries) and the dataset README; the four dataset artefacts are SHA-256 locked and verified fail-closed at every run (L97-129), including the new reference table; the registry YAML lists the new input. Deductions: no digitised data from Saunders, Summerbell or Tickle (1981) are vendored — the reference table is an ordinal summary written for this loop (-3); Summerbell (1974) has no DOI and the PubMed record is the only resolvable identifier (-2)." ;
