        dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Panel E still overlays the SHA-256-pinned CC BY 4.0 dorsal somite SEM with detected rosette centres and clefts on both rows (L1223-1275), Panel A/G now show the 2D wedge rosette and a 3D cut-away shell whose constricted red apical faces around a dark somitecoel read as an epithelial somite rosette in cross-section, and the GIF shows the rosette tightening as the live gamma_ap ramps. Deductions: the vendored `rosette_metrics` (lower row 8 somites, spacing 47.14 px, CV 0.2010) contradict the script's own segmentation (lower row 10 peaks, 45.375 px, CV 0.2391), the v2 audit quoted the JSON value, and neither has been reconciled, only disclosed (L1441-1446, reference JSON L78 provenance_note_pass3) (-6); no image from Yamanaka (2023) or Miao (2023) is compared side by side, so the 3D shell and the stage series are matched to a single number (0.305) rather than to the authors' somitoid sections (-5); the SEM is a vertebrate dorsal view of in-vivo somites rather than an in-vitro somitoid, as in Pass 2 (-3)." ;
