        dct:description "IMEX sparse-LU polar-sector solver (rho in [0.25, 1], theta in [-100, 100] deg, 48x96) equilibrated at 3 arcs (radial spacing 3.4369 = lambda_c +/- 1.06%, angular coherence 1.0000) then grown exponentially to s = 2.6; first mid-trough arc insertion at s = 2.1825, arc counts on 5 transects = [6, 6, 6, 6, 6]" ;
        dct:source "Kondo & Asai (1995) Nature 376(6543):765-768 Figs. 1-2 (3 -> 6 mid-trough doubling) transferred to the concentric C-shaped juvenile P. semicirculatus geometry; Lean theorem kondo_asai_1995_curvilinear_mid_trough_threshold_partition (concentric_arcs 3 2 = 6)" ;
        rdfs:comment "final radial spacing 4.6121 (1.328 lambda_c, CV 0.137) with angular coherence 0.9996: arcs stay concentric through insertion; cascade still relaxing at s = 2.6 (span 7.8 lambda_c)" ;
        prov:wasGeneratedBy "script" ;
        schema:about "Pomacanthus semicirculatus & Pomacanthus imperator (marine angelfish)" ;
        schema:error 0e+00 ;
        schema:targetValue 6e+00 ;
        schema:unitText "concentric arcs (central radial transect)" ;
        schema:value 6e+00 .

    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-19-pomacanthus-stripe-insertion-audit-v3-kondo-pomacanthus-stripe-insertion-2> a schema:QuantitativeValue,
            pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "mid-trough inhibitor I_mid at first concentric arc insertion vs zero-activator threshold c_3/|c_2|" ;
        dct:description "minimum of I along the central radial transect between adjacent arcs, sampled every 50 steps during growth; pre-insertion I_mid(s) is strictly decreasing (Spearman rho = -1.000); value is the last pre-insertion sample" ;
        dct:source "Kondo & Asai (1995) piecewise-linear synthesis F = max(0, c_1 A + c_2 I + c_3) with A = 0 => insertion iff I < c_3/|c_2| = 0.625 (Lean theorem kondo_asai_1995_curvilinear_mid_trough_threshold_partition)" ;
        rdfs:comment "insertion fires ~20% above the zero-activator threshold because diffusive activator supply from the flanking arcs (A_trough ~ 0.05-0.1) and the 0.004 background fluctuations raise the local synthesis before I_mid itself crosses 0.625; the Lean bound is the sufficient (A = 0) condition" ;
        prov:wasGeneratedBy "script" ;
        schema:about "Pomacanthus semicirculatus & Pomacanthus imperator (marine angelfish)" ;
        schema:error 1.8784e+01 ;
        schema:targetValue 6.25e-01 ;
        schema:unitText "inhibitor concentration (model units)" ;
        schema:value 7.424e-01 .

