            pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "Law 1 (TAME light cone) - BVP spatial reach at G_gj = 1.0, N = 100, G_half = 0.1" ;
        dct:description "sum_i V_i / V_0 of the 100-cell steady state (script L186-L201); reproduced; G_gj = 0 gives 1.0, G_gj = 0.5 gives 22.8602. The law's metric (L728) and asserted quantity (L848-L849)" ;
        dct:source "Continuum limit of the same diffusion-leak equation, sqrt(G/k) tanh(N sqrt(k/G)) with k = G_half/N = 0.001 (script L210; referee re-derivation of the closed form); no published reach exists in Levin (2019) Front. Psychol. 10:2688 or Levin (2022) Front. Syst. Neurosci. 16:768201" ;
        rdfs:comment "1.6 % discrepancy is the discrete-vs-continuum correction. Physically this is the electrotonic space constant of a passive cable, lambda = sqrt(G/k); nothing in it is specific to TAME or to cognition" ;
