            pk:Concept ;
        rdfs:label "Chimeric Algotype Domain-Wall Aggregation & C=2 Anti-Clustering Law" ;
        dct:description "Refutes the textbook duplicate-key sort stability critique by proving both unique-key kinematic waves and C=2 anti-clustering | Variables: A(t): same-algotype neighbor fraction; C = n/K: duplicate copies per key" ;
